// Repro: `combo Pair where same Rank` must match only the paired cards
// (fixed 2026-08, D-5). Before the fix the per-card matcher compared each
// card against itself, so every card with a Rank matched (score 3); the
// group-wise evaluation yields exactly the pair (score 2).
// Note: the read-side syntax is `<comboName> in <groupable>`.
player P1
turnorder (P:P1)
location Hand on P:P1
location Deck on table

combo Pair where same Rank

card on Deck: Rank(Ace, Ace, Two) for Suit(Diamonds)

stage Play for current 1 times {
  deal 3 from Deck private to Hand
  score size(cards Pair in Hand) to P:P1
  end stage
}
